{"id":"question-math-linear-function-graph-6","subject":"math","type":"single-choice","prompt":"常數函數 y=a 在 x=5 時的函數值為 -3，則 a 為何？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"-5"},{"id":"B","text":"-3"},{"id":"C","text":"3"},{"id":"D","text":"5"}],"knowledgeIds":["kg-math-content-f-8-2"],"difficulty":"easy","answer":{"value":"B","explanation":"常數函數對所有 x 的函數值都等於 a，因此 a=-3。"},"provenance":{"origin":"original","license":"All rights reserved","sourceUrl":"https://csjh.kl.edu.tw/books/file/395/110-2-1%E5%9C%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%B8%E6%AE%B5%E8%80%83%E8%A9%A6%E9%A1%8C%E5%8F%8A%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88.pdf","sourceLocator":"基隆市立中山高中 110 學年度下學期國中部二年級段考第 19 題的能力目標；本題重新設計數據與選項","authoringNote":"獨立改編，非原題重製。"},"reviewStatus":"draft","updatedAt":"2026-08-28","lessonId":"lesson-math-linear-function-graph"}
